{title: Tu Pyar Ka Sagar Hai}
{artist: Manna Dey Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em],        Tu pyaar ka saagar hai
[Am] [D],        Teri ek boond ke pyaase hum
[Em],        Lauta jo diya tune
[Am] [D],        Chale jaayenge jahaan se hum
[Em] [Am] [Em],        Ghaayal mann ka paagal panchhi
[D] [Em],        Udne ko beqaraar
[Em] [Am] [Em],        Pankh hai komal aankh hai dhundli
[D] [Em],        Jaana hai saagar paar
[Am] [Em],        Jaana hai saagar paar
[Em],        Ab tu hi isse samjha
[Am] [D],        Raah bhoole the kahan se hum
[Em] [Am] [Em],        Idhar jhoom ke gaaye zindagi
[D] [Em],        Udhar hai maut khadi
[Em] [Am] [Em],        Koi kya jaane kahaan hai seema
[D] [Em],        Uljhan aan padi
[Am] [Em],        Uljhan aan padi
[Em],        Kaanon mein zara keh de
[Am] [D],        Ke aaye kaun disha se hum
